# Making the Grade (windurst 4): the arms the first mutant round showed untaken: its Event lines at Chomoro-Kyotoro
# and Fuepepe next to a rival, so an Event and a Progress line differ. Accepted by GM at Prog 1 with Let Sleeping Dogs
# Lie accepted too (Prog 0: its 489 at Chomoro-Kyotoro, 493 at Fuepepe, both Events), Teacher's Pet completed, a
# level-10 WAR, fame 225, Class Reunion accepted at ClassReunionProgress 3 (Fuepepe's script: 817 on its turn while
# ClassReunion_TalkedToFupepe is 0; reset by GM). The lookup: two Event lines of one handler cycle in the container
# order (Let Sleeping Dogs Lie's first), resuming after the last line played; Fuepepe's Event lines take turns with his
# script. Prog 1: Chomoro-Kyotoro 489 / 457 / 489; Fuepepe 493 / 817 / 456. Prog 3: Chomoro-Kyotoro 461 / 489. Prog 2:
# Fuepepe 817 / 493 / his script (nothing) and 458; 458 with a full bag (complete fails: Prog 2 stays).
lists WindurstWaters/Chomoro-Kyotoro/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Fuepepe/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/458
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=165.5,-1.25,161.1 job=WAR lvl=10
quest Windurst.TeachersPet completed
quest Windurst.LetSleepingDogsLie accepted
quest Windurst.MakingTheGrade accepted
charvar Quest[2][4]Prog 1
quest Windurst.ClassReunion accepted
charvar ClassReunionProgress 3
fame Windurst 225
login
trigger Chomoro-Kyotoro                       # Prog 1: two Event lines: Let Sleeping Dogs Lie's 489 first
finish
trigger Chomoro-Kyotoro                       # the next line: this quest's 457 (an Event)
finish
trigger Chomoro-Kyotoro                       # the cycle wraps: 489
finish
trigger Fuepepe                               # Prog 1: Let Sleeping Dogs Lie's 493 (the first of two Event lines)
finish
trigger Fuepepe                               # his script's turn: Class Reunion's 817
finish                                        # ClassReunion_TalkedToFupepe 1
charvar ClassReunion_TalkedToFupepe 0
trigger Fuepepe                               # the next line: this quest's 456 (an Event)
finish
charvar Quest[2][4]Prog 3
trigger Chomoro-Kyotoro                       # Prog 3: the cycle resumes after 489: this quest's 461
finish
trigger Chomoro-Kyotoro                       # the cycle wraps: 489 (461 is an Event)
finish
charvar Quest[2][4]Prog 2
trigger Fuepepe                               # Prog 2: his script's turn (the last line here was an Event): 817
finish
trigger Fuepepe                               # the quest's turn: Let Sleeping Dogs Lie's 493 (the cycle resumes after 456)
finish
trigger Fuepepe                               # his script's turn (ClassReunion_TalkedToFupepe 1: nothing), then the next line: 458
fill-inventory
finish                                        # the scroll does not fit: complete fails: nothing; Prog 2
free-inventory
